<title>UK: Russian Avtobank sets $35 million Nov 1997 FRN. [CORRECTED 11.10 GMT]</title>
<headline>Russian Avtobank sets $35 million Nov 1997 FRN. [CORRECTED 11.10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets and Moscow Norodny.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AVTOBANK OF RUSSIA</p>
<p> AMT    $35 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    07.NOV.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +500 BP   PAY DATE    15.MAY.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  PAR	 LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 50</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>(CORRECTS PAY DATE FROM JUNE 03, TO READ MAY 15.) - London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
